msgstr "Penggunaan"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/can-shield.rst:76
msgid ""
"The ``CAN(1)`` peripheral number below follows the STM32 mapping. On another"
" processor the bus wired to these pins may be different — check your board's"
" reference."
msgstr ""
"Nomor periferal ``CAN(1)`` di bawah mengikuti pemetaan STM32. Pada prosesor "
"lain, bus yang terhubung ke pin ini mungkin berbeda — periksa referensi "
"papan Anda."

